Critters 2: The Main Course (also known as Critters 2) is a 1988 American science fiction comedy horror film
directed by Mick Garris in his directorial debut, and the second installment in the Critters franchise.

11
00:55:38,823 --> 00:55:44,823
A direct sequel to Critters, the film was written by David Twohy and Garris, and stars
Scott Grimes, Don Keith Opper and Terrence Mann reprising their roles.

12
01:00:42,352 --> 01:00:48,352
The plot takes place two years after the first film, as a batch of planted Critter eggs
begin to hatch and resume their carnivorous appetite upon the town once again.

13
01:05:45,882 --> 01:05:51,882
